 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Not at all. It' worth mentioning so they can be mindful of you. A small inhaler is helpful too. You could say Something else I' worried about is my nut allergy. Would you mind a lot if I brought an inhaler? Say it only you and your allergy know about. It puts your worry at ease without anyone else noticing. Not necessarily, but it' nice for the bride and groom that you eat something. Ask the venue first, it might be part of the menu already. You won't be if you ask about the inhaler first. Everyone feels worse than they seem right after saying yes to getting married.",
